        "text": "1,000 rupee government enforced entrance fee ( helps with restoration ) I had an official guide / which I don’t normally bother with but there is so much history, culture and information to take in I thought it well worth it and my guide was excellent for 2000 rupees. I was there for more than 2.5 hrs - Quite strange to stand and observe the end of life for the Hindu religion. I would definitely recommend a visit here as it is the most holiest temple for Hindus in Nepal.  ",
